  {
   "t": "group",
   "id": "5dbc2a7",
   "children": [
    {
     "t": "text",
     "html": "<p><a href=\"/menu/\"><img data-ref=\"https://www.thehighway90.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/halloween-popup-.png\" alt=\"Highway 90 image\"></a></p><p>Get ready for a frightfully fun weekend — <strong>Halloweed at Highway 90</strong> is just around the corner! Join us for two days of festive fun, <em>spooktacular deals</em>, and community vibes on <strong>Friday, October 31st, and Saturday, November 1st</strong> at <strong>Highway 90 Dispensary in Marlton, NJ</strong>.</p><p>Whether you’re stopping by for top-tier cannabis deals, giveaways from your favorite brands, or just a good time, this is one Halloween event you won’t want to miss.</p><h3>👻 Costume Contest: Dress to Impress (and Get a 1¢ Pre-Roll!)</h3><p>Show off your Halloween spirit and creativity! Customers who come in costume will receive a <strong>1¢ pre-roll with any purchase</strong>, and those with the best costumes will be entered to win <strong>extra prizes</strong> as part of our <em>overall costume contest</em>.</p><p>So grab your best fit — scary, funny, or just plain clever — and let’s see what you’ve got!</p><h3>🎁 Giveaways from Your Favorite Cannabis Brands</h3><p>This Halloweed weekend, shopping your favorite brands at <strong>Highway 90</strong> comes with even more perks. Every purchase automatically enters you into <strong>exclusive brand giveaways</strong> from:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"/brands/farmers-market/\">Farmers Market</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/brands/clade9/\">Clade9</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/brands/locals-only/\">Locals Only</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/brands/jersey-smooth/\">Jersey Smooth</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/?s=lowell+herb+co\">Lowell Herb Co</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/brands/wyld/\">Wyld</a></p></li></ul><p>Plus, every purchase enters you into the <strong>Highway 90 Giveaway</strong> for even more chances to win big!</p><h3>🌭 Hot Dogs, Pumpkin Painting &amp; Pop-Ups</h3><p>We’re keeping the vibes high (and your stomachs full) with <strong>Hot Dogs from Rock’s Dogs</strong>, along with pop-ups from some of the best cannabis brands in New Jersey.</p><p>And for those who love a little creativity, stop by our <strong>Pumpkin Painting Station!</strong></p><p>The first <strong>25 customers</strong> through the door will also score a <strong>Highway 90 goodie bag with any purchase</strong>, packed with surprises and treats.</p><h3>🕸️ Don’t Miss These Storewide Deals!</h3><p>Of course, it wouldn’t be a Highway 90 celebration without some <em>hauntingly good deals</em>. Enjoy <strong>storewide savings</strong> on your favorite products — from <a href=\"/categories/flower/\">flower</a> and <a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/\">pre-rolls</a> to <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/\">vapes</a>, <a href=\"/categories/edibles/\">edibles</a>, and more.</p><p>Stop in-store to see all the limited-time offers available during the event!</p><h3>🪩 Join the Fun at Highway 90 in Marlton, NJ</h3><p>If you’ve been waiting for the perfect reason to visit <strong>Highway 90</strong>, this is it. Celebrate Halloweed with your favorite local South Jersey dispensary — where the <strong>deals are scary good, and the vibes are even better.</strong></p><p>📍 <strong>Highway 90 Dispensary</strong><br>Marlton, New Jersey<br>🗓️ October 31st &amp; November 1st<br>🎃 Costume Contest • Giveaways • Pop-Ups • Pumpkin Painting • <a href=\"/specials/\">Storewide Deals</a></p><p>Come for the deals, stay for the fun — and don’t forget to come in costume!</p>",
     "from": "content"
    }
   ]
